$$\cI_0 \ni I \mapsto H^{(k)}(I):=\{[f^{(k-1)}]\in\cH^{(1)}: f\in\cC_0^\infty(\RR),\supp f\subset I\}^-\subseteq H^{(1)}(I), \qquad 1\leq k\in\NN,$$
