\title{Multipath-Enhanced Measurement of Antenna Patterns: Theory}
\author{Daniel D. Stancil, \IEEEmembership{Life Fellow, IEEE}\thanks{The author is with the Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering, North Carolina State University, Raleigh, NC 27695 USA (e-mail: ddstanci@ncsu.edu). }}
