$\Delta W_j = \sqrt{\Delta t} \xi_j,  \quad\quad \xi_j \sim N(0,1)$ & $W_N=\sqrt{\Delta t_{N0}}\xi_1, \quad\quad \xi_j \sim N(0,1)$  \\
$W_j = W_{j-1} + \Delta W_j$ & $W_j=\frac{\Delta t_{kj}}{\Delta t_{ki}}W_i + \frac{\Delta t_{ji}}{\Delta t_{ki}}W_k + \sqrt{\frac{\Delta t_{kj}\Delta t_{ji}}{\Delta t_{ki}}}\xi_l$\\
