\end{figure}

The dataset collecting 1110 patients' CT was categorized into 5 patient-level labels based on severity of CT0 (Inconsistent with pneumonia, 254 samples, 22.8\%), CT1 (Alveoli impacted in a scale of 25\% or below, 684 samples, 61.6\%), CT2 (25-50\% alveoli impacted, 125 samples, 11.3\%), CT3 (50-75\% alveoli impacted, 45 samples, 4.1\%) and CT4 (75\% and above alveoli impacted, 2 samples, 0.2\%). And each patient's CT will contain multiple scanning layers having the same label as the patient label. The data distribution is shown in Fig. \ref{dataset2}

