_{\infty}$ functors.
Given  $\mathcal{D} $ as above, in Part I we constructed
a functor $$F _{P,k}: \Delta (X) \to A _{\infty}Cat ^{\mathbb{Z}
_{2}} _{k}.$$ This functor
has certain additional properties. 

