\begin{lemma}
\label{lemma:empty0} 
Whenever the class $A$ is such that ${\mathcal{M}}$ has virtual dimension $0$, and $d$ satisfies $2 < d \leq 4$, $\overline {\mathcal{M}}$ is empty.
\end{lemma}
\begin{proof}
   Let $$\Theta ^{/} := (\Theta ^{+}) ^{/},   $$ and $A ^{/}
	 $ be the capping off construction as 
	 in ~\cite[Section 2.7]{cite_SavelyevQuantumMaslov}. For a fixed $r$,
