$v \in [10^{15}, 10^{17}]$ GeV: Symmetry breaking scale

For each parameter set, we compute the bubble action, nucleation rate, and critical field value. The results show that the transition occurs at energy scales $E_c \sim 10^{15}-10^{17}$ GeV for all physically reasonable parameter choices.

