	\caption{The null boundary of one-dimensional FCA}
	\label{Fig2-1}
\end{figure}

Periodic boundary regards the configuration as a circle, which fills the cells left-outside the configuration according to the rightmost cells. The example of the periodic boundary is also shown in Fig. \ref{Fig2-2}.

